{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a08ebd70b1855d9c7ff839fcf0aca7d16e288ff748373db40a86acd619d019d", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』の撮影。エレナのテーマは、\n『幼馴染と再会』か。……ん？　この声は……）", "zh": "（今天是『アイグラ！！』的拍摄。艾蕾娜的主题是『与青梅竹马重逢』吗。……嗯？这个声音是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a9659ed5b99a828b5d23ce70047b051d07a5431d262542dec5e6d0d68fc398f9", "ja": "「久しぶり！\n……なんだかちょっと、緊張しちゃうね」", "zh": "好久不见！\n……总觉得有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "99890f7fae290d164490b7c10f33973336b23c1a1b5f7762b76e12508e9d3bfb", "ja": "「{$P$}くん、もう大人だね。\n私は、どう？　すこしは成長したかナ……？」", "zh": "「{$P$}君，已经是大人了呢。\n我呢，感觉怎么样？稍微有点成长了嘛……？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1003_p", "source_sha256": "97aabef11cff7fbdf0f35cfa0b420a6f0544dfaaab76160962793ef66aeedbe7", "ja": "エレナ？　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "艾莉娜？怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "369129dad07df6b3cb8804b282444b6259d0b3cf52bca0661106fcdea163054e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n……アハッ、目がまん丸だヨ～？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n……啊哈，你的眼睛瞪得圆溜溜的哟～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "da363176a232097c18a7489568803a3ba667f583f1480030a2c1b413700bbddd", "ja": "今のは、ワタシの写真のイメージテキスト？だって。\nこの文章が、写真と一緒に載るって聞いたヨ。", "zh": "刚才那个，据说是给我的照片配的文案？  \n听说这段文字会和照片一起刊登出来哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b8e80bacd133c0c1f1cca846093191a71ffbc183d619efca0a64a52d447b60ed", "ja": "あ、本当だ。今日の資料に書いてあったな……。\nいや、不意打ちだったから驚いたよ。", "zh": "啊，真的。今天的资料上写着呢……\n不，毕竟是突然看到的，所以吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "619a9ef7ac677f39cdccb1a87f8d3ec80bc5b97d86a3556fe7f0199d63afdf6f", "ja": "エヘヘ。ワタシも、『幼馴染と再会』って\nどんな感じなのカナ～？と思って、読んでみたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。我也想着“和青梅竹马重逢”会是什么感觉呢～，就读了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "d7fb224e1756c2fb6b26603cd4e723d7b80c33004d6ff9b8848ad642cdac152b", "ja": "雰囲気はわかったんだけど……でも、どうして\nワンピースが『幼馴染と再会』なのか、わからないノ。", "zh": "我明白那种氛围了，可是……为什么连衣裙会是“青梅竹马重逢”，我还是不明白呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0fd7581ebae17dfb54b332da28852ccad3f7406f8892751455eb12b69f1f5d5", "ja": "{$P$}は、どうしてかわかる？", "zh": "{$P$}知道是为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3e245c1bd1d6dc1af20da0c2ef715f161000598bc04edc2bfaaae1fa1afcb192", "ja": "そうだな……白いワンピースを着た姿が、\nノスタルジーを掻き立てるというか……。", "zh": "是啊……该说是穿着白色连衣裙的样子，会勾起人的怀旧情绪吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1011_p", "source_sha256": "41f3bd6a9ea9d3c1c8192e262457f5687d9e8469754cb99214658c791f95cd0d", "ja": "原風景みたいなものかな。現実にはなくても、\n懐かしい思い出のように感じるというか。", "zh": "大概就是……类似心中最初的风景吧。即使现实中并不存在，也会让人觉得像是怀念的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "e00242a5e9e72cd892f101b074227c9d56270c5168eb6b3bdf5fa4e6bdb57aad", "ja": "そっかぁ。……じゃあ{$P$}も、\n懐かしい気分になったりする？", "zh": "这样啊……那{$P$}也会有怀念的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1013_p", "source_sha256": "099d2d6d1dcaf39de2a67a41b1bb141e20ede143ce69ff7804c8a4abde78beb9", "ja": "うん、そうかもしれない。\nエレナは、何に懐かしさを感じるんだ？", "zh": "嗯，或许是吧。\n艾莲娜会对什么感到怀念呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "72623b78b714adc2aba6065fc4852e948b708d713591b35dd388c75665a8a5a3", "ja": "ワタシが懐かしさを感じるとしたら……\nやっぱり、サッカーボールかな？", "zh": "如果要说让我感到怀念的东西……果然还是足球吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "4de652b9f59bbf05129e3c79213c3ec1f527b964c96a61c355feed92dd7c4d15", "ja": "小さいころは、友達といつも遊んでたからネ。\nボロボロになったボールをみると、切なくなるヨ～。", "zh": "小时候我总是和朋友一起玩呢。\n看到变破的足球，就会觉得有些难过呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1016_p", "source_sha256": "733cea037b4f1c65707caf6e86fffe748d06f3c9a2ed109dbd610e630de900ed", "ja": "そうか。エレナがボールに感じるその切なさと\n似た物を、白いワンピースに感じるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "这样啊。也许我会对那条白色连衣裙产生和艾蕾娜看到球时相似的伤感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "86248e0356f2891c394865de7ca1e1056f0ae14e0ec46503a2ace8ae3a916c97", "ja": "うん……なんか、ちょっとだけわかったかも？\nどんな写真になるようにって、がんばればいいか……。", "zh": "嗯……好像，稍微弄懂了一点？\n要怎样努力，才能拍出想要的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "1af909f59d1a218a351ad12816cc665ef7d7c934f5b3571858ef43d858a4c16c", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}♪\n……あっ、そろそろ撮影始まるみたいだネ。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}♪\n……啊，拍摄好像差不多要开始了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0203_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "759cf9fd170bbb4642faa5384112efea30c66627eb8c8a33112130c993cb73a7", "ja": "ワタシ、ステキに撮ってもらうから！\n{$P$}、い～っぱい切なくなってネ！", "zh": "我会让他们把我拍得美美的！\n{$P$}，要变得超级超级难过哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
